78488,"h":0.011803603434300758,"y":0.26017441854256895,"text":"of food products in the box. Then listen, check and","w":0.37448557535807292},{"text":"repeat.","y":0.27569373729015156,"x":0.54098756451243679,"w":0.055884954664442321,"h":0.011112525287190866},{"w":0.010288065804375579,"y":0.29796511666625003,"x":0.51646090547229784,"h":0.010174418169437871,"text":"9"},{"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.54320987006172861,"y":0.29788069073405765,"text":"4) 1.43 Look at the photos in Exercise 5 and decide","w":0.38888888888888895},{"x":0.54115226465868516,"text":"what food products Jack needs to buy. Use the","w":0.35390947129991324,"h":0.011773940345368938,"y":0.31240188379259792},{"y":0.32692307686445166,"text":"words in WORD STORE 2B. Then listen and check.","w":0.37654320610894099,"x":0.54115226584127707,"h":0.011773940345368827},{"y":0.3502906981187528,"w":0.40123453776041662,"h":0.013131593797045982,"text":"10 1.43 Complete the sentences from the dialogue","x":0.51646092642157471},{"h":0.01162790690711013,"y":0.36482558139382859,"w":0.37448557535807292,"text":"with one word in each gap. Listen again and check.","x":0.54115227873042837},{"w":0.36625512017144102,"text":"1 For the brownies, we need a packet of_butter,","h":0.013088240541131779,"y":0.38226059642369103,"x":0.5432098930521394},{"y":0.3952119306893378,"w":0.22633744981553827,"h":0.013343799058084693,"text":"a packet of flour and a carton of","x":0.54115226048317744},{"w":0.15432098388671878,"text":"2 Jack: What about","x":0.54115226783030312,"y":0.41130298276825927,"h":0.010208644896885999},{"x":0.767000544697233,"h":0.015025784119706231,"text":"? You aways use","w":0.11616196526421441,"y":0.40925844409057155},{"text":"a lot of it.","y":0.4243063279297884,"w":0.06796795315212667,"x":0.55757980971424259,"h":0.010398971791170109},{"y":0.43877551024760297,"text":"Mum: Yes, get two bars.","w":0.17078189425998269,"x":0.55967078411143512,"h":0.01180588506641711},{"y":0.453296703163099,"text":"3 Jack: What else?","