e with the rest of the class."},{"h":0.013081394896215293,"y":0.69767441861293888,"x":0.54320988172515328,"text":"1 Do you invite friends to study together?","w":0.29218105740017353},{"x":0.55761316896199042,"text":"How often?","y":0.71220930261586246,"w":0.098765428331163196,"h":0.010318169975580216},{"text":"2 What do you usually eat when your friends come?","y":0.72674418612977831,"w":0.36213992648654514,"h":0.011627906907110019,"x":0.54320986912984126},{"w":0.36008229573567707,"x":0.543209883373588,"h":0.013111057610863619,"text":"3 What do you need to prepare the food? Name as","y":0.7397959186889882},{"h":0.01162790690711013,"w":0.20781892564561633,"x":0.55761317438569646,"y":0.75581395347473945,"text":"many ingredients as you can."},{"w":0.21399176703559031,"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.54320987993899494,"y":0.76883830461335345,"text":"4 What's your favourite snack?"},{"w":0.3930041164822049,"h":0.011773940345368827,"text":"5 Do you ever get a takeaway for dinner? Where do you","x":0.5432098808278274,"y":0.78335949780755276},{"x":0.55555555680460766,"text":"get it from?","w":0.08436214023166233,"y":0.79788069091454261,"h":0.011773940345368827},{"y":0.81104651157551488,"w":0.28189300537109374,"h":0.011627906907110019,"text":"6 What do you usually have for dessert?","x":0.54320987873420612},{"y":0.82848837253735752,"h":0.013081394896215293,"x":0.54320988732926911,"w":0.358024664984809,"text":"My room is very small, so I don't often invite friends"},{"w":0.37037034776475686,"y":0.84301412889757155,"h":0.011773940345368938,"text":"to study - maybe once a month, or when we can use","x":0.54115228085013167},{"x":0.54115225987212268,"y":0.85753532182407644,"text":"my sister's room. When my friends come, we often get","h":0.011773940345368827,"w":0.38065843370225694},{"x":0.5410679170238164,"text":"a pizza.","w":0.057781859503852062,"h":0.012052103339035058,"y":0.87188092511603499},{"y":0.95348837224665972,"w":0.024691357082790799,"text":"25","h":0.013081394896215293,"x":0.90740740805472453}]